# pnpm 10 blocks lifecycle scripts by default.
# Allowed packages are declared in `pnpm-workspace.yaml:onlyBuiltDependencies`
# (electron, esbuild, electron-winstaller). Keep this file free of
# onlyBuiltDependencies so there is a single source of truth.
# See also: scripts/postinstall.mjs — Electron 42+ lazy-download fix.
